  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Azure Queue Storage — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for Azure.Storage.Queues QueueClient. Includes a built-in QueueStorageTransientErrors predicate covering throttling (429), service unavailability (503), and gateway timeouts (504). Completes the Azure storage suite alongside PollyAzureBlob and PollyAzureTableStorage.",
